# Allowlist for the sync-api build context (the repository root).
#
# The first non-comment line is '*': everything in the context is denied unless
# a later '!' line allows it. A '!' line for a directory re-includes everything
# beneath it, so no ancestor lines are written; each line below names exactly
# what a COPY needs. The sync-api recipe COPYs the installDist tree
# server/modules/sync-api/build/install/sync-api/, so that tree is the only
# path re-included here.
*
!server/modules/sync-api/build/install/sync-api/**
